# WinTweaker AI Assistant Rules

## Environment & Toolchain
- Platform: .NET Framework 4.6.2 (WPF / XAML)
- Compiler: C# 5.0 (C:\Windows\Microsoft.NET\Framework64\v4.0.30319\MSBuild.exe)
- DO NOT use C# 6.0+ syntax: no string interpolation ($"..."), no null propagation (?.), no nameof(), no expression-bodied members (=>), no read-only auto-properties.
- Binary size constraint: strictly < 5.0 MB for Tweaker.exe.

## Build & Test Commands
- Build: powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\build.ps1
- Run Tests: .\dist\Tests.exe
- Target: All 7660 tests MUST pass (7660 PASS / 0 FAIL). Never accept regressions.

## Theme & UI Standards
- Palette: Tokyo Night Tachyon Dark (#0B0B12 background, #0F0F17 sidebar, #101018 header, #12121B card, #242434 border, #8B7CF6 accent).
- DWM Titlebar colors in NativeMethods.ApplyWindowFrameColors must match WindowBg (#0B0B12 / #F3F3F8).
- Keep search box fixed width (380px) with CaretBrush="{DynamicResource TextPrimary}".
- Scrollbar must remain an overlay 4px track to prevent layout jumping.
- Cleanup category tweaks must be action buttons [🗑 Очистить], not toggles.

## Safety Architecture
- Default mode is MockRegistryStore (no real registry changes). Real mode requires --real flag and admin elevation.
- 850 tweaks defined in data/tweaks.json according to data/tweaks.schema.json.
- Refer to AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md for full architecture details.
